          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] without delay [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... If God] forbid, I delay ...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] before marrying her, there will be [...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]... fully weighed dinars eigh[t...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">... and one third ...\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the betrothal (qiddush) and twenty-five ...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">And these are what this [...] brought ...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u2026</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and house furnishings, copper vessels, and clothing \u2026</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">dinars, remainder ... this [...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and he will pay three and will take ...\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this girl ...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">they will acquire all that re[mains ...]</li></ol>\n",
